<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Privacy Notice | SecureLocal</title><meta name="theme-color" content="#c2410c"><link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns=%27http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%27 viewBox=%270 0 100 100%27%3E%3Ctext y=%27.9em%27 font-size=%2790%27%3E🍕%3C/text%3E%3C/svg%3E"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css"><script src="/js/theme.js"></script><script src="/js/app.js" defer></script></head><body><%- include('partials/nav',{user,csrfToken}) %><main class="narrow"><article class="panel"><p class="eyebrow">PRIVACY NOTICE</p><h1>Your information and privacy</h1><p>SecureLocal is a local class-project prototype. It stores your username and email, your orders, the incident reports you submit, and security events needed to run and protect the demo. Please use made-up data only.</p><h2>How we use and protect information</h2><ul><li>Account details are used to sign in and manage your account.</li><li>Order contact numbers and addresses are encrypted with AES-256-GCM before they are stored.</li><li>Passwords are stored as bcrypt hashes. Audit records help the team review security events.</li></ul><h2>Your choices</h2><p>After signing in, use My Data to see and download your own information or submit a correction or deletion request. An administrator reviews requests and records the outcome. You may choose not to register; the prototype is not a production service.</p><h2>Retention and contact</h2><p>Made-up demo data stays in the local project database until the project operator removes it. For questions or to stop using this demo, contact the project team. Do not enter real personal, payment, or customer information.</p><a class="button" href="/register">Back to registration</a></article></main></body></html>
